# Independent X/Twitter Stash filter. GPL-3.0-only. See docs/X_AD_FILTER.md.
name: X 去广告 · 时间线净化
desc: 过滤 X/Twitter 时间线和推文详情内有明确 promoted 标记的广告；保留分页与普通媒体，不额外请求服务器。JSON 接口适配预览，需 iPhone 实测；不能保证移除全部广告。
category: 去广告
version: 2026.10.24-preview.1
homepage: https://github.com/xian2023/stash-modules
http:
  mitm:
    - api.x.com
    - api.twitter.com
    - x.com
    - twitter.com
  script:
    - match: ^https://(?:api\.)?(?:twitter|x)\.com/(?:i/api/)?graphql/[^/?#]+/(?:HomeTimeline|HomeLatestTimeline|TweetDetail|SearchTimeline|UserTweets|UserTweetsAndReplies|UserMedia|ListLatestTweetsTimeline|Bookmarks|CommunityTweetsTimeline|CommunityMediaTimeline)(?:\?|$)
      name: x-timeline-ads-866381593f3498d7
      type: response
      require-body: true
      binary-mode: false
      timeout: 2
      max-size: 2097152
    - match: ^https://api\.(?:twitter|x)\.com/2/(?:timeline/(?:home|profile/\d+|conversation/\d+|list)|search/adaptive)\.json(?:\?|$)
      name: x-timeline-ads-866381593f3498d7
      type: response
      require-body: true
      binary-mode: false
      timeout: 2
      max-size: 2097152
script-providers:
  x-timeline-ads-866381593f3498d7:
    url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xian2023/stash-modules/main/scripts/x/866381593f3498d7/response.js
    interval: 86400
